{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "PSYCHExFUSE",
    "steam_appid": 2922140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/a2e9a1e97cd8334985842ff1ca120363.avif?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Explore unique worlds filled with threats, puzzles and horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Help, save and clash with past versions of yourself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Unravel the mystery behind two gods and a half at war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Face the consequences of your actions with alternative endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Experience beautiful hand-drawn cutscenes and a diverse, atmospheric soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Answer the question... <i>can you really trust your self</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/0fd8587ca06dfef35e2f3850af410b9e.webp?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/6360f3f0b1f89d9c5c8d21df7dacf649.poster.avif?t=1753795804\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/6360f3f0b1f89d9c5c8d21df7dacf649.webm?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/6360f3f0b1f89d9c5c8d21df7dacf649.mp4?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wandering soul finds themselves lost in an eerie dreamscape filled with familiar yet discomforting wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can they come back to reality, or be doomed into torment by the creatures wandering galleries, theatres and gardens?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A sprawling world of nostalgia that seems a bit too dark, abandoned, and almost inhuman...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/8703e536817bfac1cce40df1f5a513c9.webp?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9f5fe6550810292b5510cf6908c2c3b4.poster.avif?t=1753795804\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9f5fe6550810292b5510cf6908c2c3b4.webm?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9f5fe6550810292b5510cf6908c2c3b4.mp4?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist isn't alone. Defying all logic, their younger self also finds themselves wandering the facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not everyone should trust themselves, for this mirror image poses as no friend, tripping up our hero at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;This begs the question, if there is another &quot;self&quot;... could there be many more?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/c0e8f0de6005578a54d872431eba4c2a.webp?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/1078014538418150a164602d22ceaef6.poster.avif?t=1753795804\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/1078014538418150a164602d22ceaef6.webm?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/1078014538418150a164602d22ceaef6.mp4?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A supposed goddess guides our lost lamb and promises an escape, in an exchange for becoming her vessel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her memories are gone and powers extinguished, but in spite of that, she can offer some words and encouragement to navigating her ruined land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;...Just don't ask her about her wedding.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/fd87f69ae8adbc874613606c728c57b5.webp?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/42dd568d90bf4d128e4fd8e28fdb18d2.poster.avif?t=1753795804\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/42dd568d90bf4d128e4fd8e28fdb18d2.webm?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/42dd568d90bf4d128e4fd8e28fdb18d2.mp4?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new world means new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay attentive and you might find something just as new to uncover, and perhaps understand the reason behind the lost soul's being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Lest, you too become lost between the line of fantasy and reality...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/666bd7af102085ef1f39cc35095d92e3.avif?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>PSYCHExFUSE</i></strong> will be a 3-part saga, with <strong><i>Part 1: L.C.D</i></strong> launching as an Early Access Title in late 2025. The remaining parts will be released as free updates as they are completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/a2e9a1e97cd8334985842ff1ca120363.avif?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Explore unique worlds filled with threats, puzzles and horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Help, save and clash with past versions of yourself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Unravel the mystery behind two gods and a half at war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Face the consequences of your actions with alternative endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Experience beautiful hand-drawn cutscenes and a diverse, atmospheric soundtrack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Answer the question... <i>can you really trust your self</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/0fd8587ca06dfef35e2f3850af410b9e.webp?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/6360f3f0b1f89d9c5c8d21df7dacf649.poster.avif?t=1753795804\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/6360f3f0b1f89d9c5c8d21df7dacf649.webm?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/6360f3f0b1f89d9c5c8d21df7dacf649.mp4?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wandering soul finds themselves lost in an eerie dreamscape filled with familiar yet discomforting wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can they come back to reality, or be doomed into torment by the creatures wandering galleries, theatres and gardens?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;A sprawling world of nostalgia that seems a bit too dark, abandoned, and almost inhuman...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/8703e536817bfac1cce40df1f5a513c9.webp?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9f5fe6550810292b5510cf6908c2c3b4.poster.avif?t=1753795804\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9f5fe6550810292b5510cf6908c2c3b4.webm?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/9f5fe6550810292b5510cf6908c2c3b4.mp4?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist isn't alone. Defying all logic, their younger self also finds themselves wandering the facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not everyone should trust themselves, for this mirror image poses as no friend, tripping up our hero at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;This begs the question, if there is another &quot;self&quot;... could there be many more?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/c0e8f0de6005578a54d872431eba4c2a.webp?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/1078014538418150a164602d22ceaef6.poster.avif?t=1753795804\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/1078014538418150a164602d22ceaef6.webm?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/1078014538418150a164602d22ceaef6.mp4?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A supposed goddess guides our lost lamb and promises an escape, in an exchange for becoming her vessel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her memories are gone and powers extinguished, but in spite of that, she can offer some words and encouragement to navigating her ruined land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;...Just don't ask her about her wedding.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/fd87f69ae8adbc874613606c728c57b5.webp?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/42dd568d90bf4d128e4fd8e28fdb18d2.poster.avif?t=1753795804\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/42dd568d90bf4d128e4fd8e28fdb18d2.webm?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/42dd568d90bf4d128e4fd8e28fdb18d2.mp4?t=1753795804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new world means new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay attentive and you might find something just as new to uncover, and perhaps understand the reason behind the lost soul's being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Lest, you too become lost between the line of fantasy and reality...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922140/extras/666bd7af102085ef1f39cc35095d92e3.avif?t=1753795804\" width=616 height=114 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>PSYCHExFUSE</i></strong> will be a 3-part saga, with <strong><i>Part 1: L.C.D</i></strong> launching as an Early Access Title in late 2025. The remaining parts will be released as free updates as they are completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
